  "details": "Now that the Main Menu has literally added full on pop-up boxes for it...\nHow about notification sounds?\nWould be useful for the following:\n- Joins\n- Invites\n- Requests\nIt should have options just like Steam does where you can set notifications to only play for friends, or even be toggled on individuals.\n(In my case, turning it on for ALL friends is still way too many people...)\nThere is already a third party program made to work for XS Overlay that does this for VR, made by Naaa who's now part of the team.\nTime to make it something everyone can actually use! And desktop compatible!",
